      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.89 (up from ₹7.31 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹567.8m (up 18% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹84.0m (up 90% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from 9.2% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 8% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
